<title>USA: AptarGroup Inc Q4 net climbs as sales rise.</title>
<headline>AptarGroup Inc Q4 net climbs as sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>CRYSTAL LAKE, Ill. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>AptarGroup Inc said Thursday stronger sales in all of its product lines helped the company's earnings increase in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $9.0 million, or $0.50 a share, in the period ended December 31, compared with $7.7 million, or $0.43 a share one year ago.</p>
<p>Sales climbed to $155.9 million versus $138.8 million in the corresponding period in 1995.</p>
<p>AptarGroup makes pumps and valves for personal care, pharmaceutical, household and food products.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1-3/8 Thursday at 36-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
